<title>USA: Columbia/HCA's Neeb to appear in Florida court.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA's Neeb to appear in Florida court.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A second Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp executive, Michael Neeb, was scheduled to apepar before a federal magistrate Wednesday on conspiracy and fraud charges, a court clerk said.</p>
<p>Neeb, the chief financial officer for Columbia/HCA's northern Florida division, was scheduled to appear at 1500 EDT/1900 GMT before U.S. Magistrate Howard Snyder in Jacksonville.</p>
</text>
